{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO MORE FURRIES</strong>\u00a0DEMO is a <strong>SINGLEPLAYER ROUND-BASED SURVIVAL SHOOTER</strong>. Your mission is to survive on a map called GEALACH to uncover secrets and mysteries that lead into our main game. Fight hordes of Werewolves and survive to see what we have in store for the player.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.poster.avif?t=1760485297\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.webm?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.mp4?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight massive waves of enemy Werewolves to take down the eminent threat in the world. You must fight and survive the endless waves while using a diverse arsenal of weapons that can be collected in each map to give you a fighting chance. Discover new maps that feature unique elements to the world that werewolves have now conquered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.poster.avif?t=1760485297\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.webm?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.mp4?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERFUL UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover machines to powerfully upgrade weapons in the demo to help you take out waves of enemies. Upgrade weapons to give you an advantage in the fray or choose to upgrade yourself with a tasty treat with some surprising effects. Though be careful, as with each passing wave your enemy grows stronger as well. Some upgrades may prove more useful than others.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.poster.avif?t=1760485297\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.webm?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.mp4?t=1760485297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LET'S GET HAIRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside of the No More Furries Demo you get to uncover lots of fun dialogue, gameplay elements, and teases for our main game to uncover. Fight the enemy horde in Gealach, a worn torn map located in Europe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will you last...and what will you discover?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087890?t=1760485297","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087890?t=1760485297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087890/09492df153706323c020212e341ca2707cd35d